GROUP NULL FeatureLab
$ALIAS QtALH local feature lab
$GUIDANCE
Use the lab terminal to raise and clear alarms.
Values: 0 normal, 7 MINOR, 12 MAJOR.
Notifications are captured by the local webhook receiver.
$END
GROUP FeatureLab Process
CHANNEL Process qtalh_lab:pressure -----
$ALIAS Pressure - manual alarms
CHANNEL Process qtalh_lab:temperature -----
$ALIAS Temperature - standing alarm
GROUP FeatureLab Diagnostics
CHANNEL Diagnostics qtalh_lab:chatter -----
$ALIAS Chattering alarm
CHANNEL Diagnostics qtalh_lab:maintenance -----
$ALIAS Maintenance - shelving
